Z||000015||jeffreyeffrey||12-13-2001||03:28 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by FieroLisa:<BR><B> Hey it's certainly better money than working at McDonalds and I'm NOT gonna be the spoiled brat that just spends daddy's money, so I don't mind gettin paid well for a part time job! (I got a horse and fiero addiction that I have to pay for!)<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Customer: "So will this Sprint PCS work good in my area?" <P>Lisa: "Oh yeah It's the clear alternative to cellular sir. you won't have any static it'll be crystal clear. 75000 crystal clear minutes for $29.99. So can I send one home with ya today?"  <P>Customer:"Ok, I guess the tower is only 1 mile from where I'll be using it, I'll try it."<P>ONE MONTH LATER...........<BR>Customer: "Say, I thought you said this Piece of crap was crystal clear. All I can ever hear is about every other word of what the person is saying, and sometimes if I'm lucky I can make out a sentence or two."<P>Lisa: "Well this is the clear alternative to cellular sir, I bet the words you did hear in between the blank spots were crystal clear."<P>How can you argue with that<BR>||||reg||1
