Z||000018||MinnGreenGT||12-13-2001||03:50 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by FieroLisa:<BR><B>Umm anyway I am at work now, so Minngreen I guess I will offer you some advice...I imagine its an older phone since you said you've had the service for a couple years. Take it in to get upgraded and tested and see what happens.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Thanks Lisa (yeah, it's older- one the first Nokia 6185's). And as I mentioned, I have had to replace the face, twice- and I just recently broke off the antenna (playing football with my nephews... it wasn't supposed to be "tackle"). I have since replaced the antenna (Sprint store didn't carry them, so I went to another local shop who could sell the antenna, not install it- luckily I happened to have the magic mini-torxs wrench  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">) So it's seen better days.<P>I guess I'll head back up to the local Sprint store and see what they say! Thanks again Lisa!||||reg||1
